affiliated with or endorsed by CCP Games.

The format pipeline, variant identification and error reporting in
`src/resource/formats/fsd` are original CarbonEngineJS code.

The per-table FSD schemas were removed on 2026-10-12 until their provenance
can be confirmed; the format reads nothing without a caller-supplied schema.

CarbonEngine fsd (legacy 32-bit FSD)
------------------------------------

`src/resource/formats/fsd/32` is a JavaScript port of CarbonEngine's
open-source FSD loader: BinaryLoader, BinaryLoaderHelper, FsdSchema,
SchemaTypes, FsdObject, FsdList, FsdDict, FsdDictOffsetLookup, FsdVector and
FsdUnsignedIntegerKeyMap. It keeps Carbon's class names, structure and
behaviour; each ported file names its Carbon source in its header. The port
was made from the published source only.

